gic Damage. She also gains 350 (+5% Max HP) - 350 (+20% Max HP) extra shield, 50% - 150% extra Attack Speed, and 5% - 20% Hybrid Lifesteal based on accumulated Wrath, and converts each point of Extra  and Extra  into 3.5 .","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ef6910865a6be662572e4f8b43dc7a5a.png","video":null,"cd":40.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Morph","rgb":"97,127,198"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Edith works best with heroes like Minotaur and Atlas that can more reliably CC a target first, allowing her to follow up with her own CC.","heroes":[{"id":19,"name":"Minotaur","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ecd2c0843df7ec85044dafff6bf4553.png"},{"id":93,"name":"Atlas","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d974ac796678180ff8724b88e192898b.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Edith is strong against heroes that are not very agile and on the fragile side, such as Zilong and Aulus, because her skills deal enough burst damage to eliminate them after connecting with her 2nd Skill.","heroes":[{"id":16,"name":"Zilong","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9db57da4f0daef6d432676e4f19101ed.png"},{"id":108,"name":"Aulus","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1366d775809e52ee6526b5b58d93cdff.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Edith is countered by Marksmen that can negate CC like Hanabi and Wanwan, since she will have a hard time locking them down.","heroes":[{"id":60,"name":"Hanabi","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8a9c1966feb34e85d7bdcc1ed01ffb5d.png"},{"id":89,"name":"Wanwan","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_44bfa1dc44deb8d7620605faaa9ffae7.png"}]}},"official_url":"https://play.mobilel